                    S!Express and LOGIC Information File !

			
WHAT IS S!EXPRESS ?
-------------------

        S!Express (S!X) is a BBS Software which is based on /X v2.34, but
        it is completely rewritten and offers a lot of functions you only
        could have imagined in your wildest dreams !
        All the good features you know from other BBS-Programs can be
        found in S!X ! If you want to know how to get it, look at the
        end of this text !
        
        S!X is FREEWARE ! (Everbody can copy it)

        S!X development is done by Sigma Seven and the project is
        constantly growing !
 
        He gets support from a couple of dudes which do the beta-testing
        and tools-coding and additional work (docs, etc.) !


WHAT IS LOGIC ?
---------------
        
        Some of these dudes, mentioned above, have formed a new group
        called LOGIC !

        This group will release absolutely professional tools for use
        with S!X (some may work also with /X) !

